# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599, Preacher #131 alone and selected on (44,22)).
# The CHEAT menu itself (mouse path; Alt-C opens it once unlocked with Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-N). Rows are ~8 px apart from y 14: Create Unit 14, Debug Info Flags 22,
# Reveal Map 38, Set Human 46, Kill Indians 61, Advance Revolution 69, Sound Test 85, Memory Check 94, Show Strategy 109, Show Colony Sites 117, Test Routine 125.
# Create Unit -> Scout is the only row that changes the save (a French Scout joins the Preacher's tile); the other rows are opened and cancelled, or are status/overlay toggles.
# Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W).
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key c alt
shot
click 220 14             # Create Unit
shot
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down                 # row 4: Scout
key Return
key c alt
click 220 22             # Debug Info Flags: list opens ...
key Escape               # ... and is cancelled
key c alt
click 220 38             # Reveal Map: list opens ...
shot
key Escape               # ... and is cancelled
key c alt
click 220 85             # Sound Test: @SOUND "Play what sound #?" number prompt (menu-only row, no hotkey)
shot
key 5
key Return               # plays sound #5 (status line only; the test harness has no audio)
key c alt
click 220 94             # Memory Check: status line only
key c alt
click 220 125            # Test Routine: status line only
key c alt
click 220 109            # Show Strategy on
key c alt
click 220 109            # Show Strategy off
shot
key w alt
